msgstr "Thao tác từ bộ phận IT"

#: usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/caramos_business/transparency.py:146
msgid ""
"IT can lock the machine, send a message, restart or shut it down when "
"needed; you are always told first. Remote help starts only if you accept."
